  m_text: 'The main antagonist in Square Adventure Dimensions, an evil flame who
    roams the world, pulling other games into their dimensions, you must stop it
    before every place, even your own is destroyed.


    Original Game Description:
    You Install an infected operating system and have to find a way to uninstall
    it, A microgame consisting of puzzles platforming and an epic bossfight.'
